# Concept Range From Int Source Example
# Concept Range where the source concept values are ordered sequentially.
# From Story128/Story129: CPL Concepts Parser/Analyzer - Concept Range

concepts
	# Source concept with ordered month names
	Month=[Values[Jan, Feb, Mar, Apr, May, Jun, Jul, Aug, Sep, Oct, Nov, Dec]]

	# Concept Range extracting the first semester from Month
	FirstSemester=[Month[Jan..Jun]]
